OL,3,GNEWSAVandals deface historic 'hanging
OL,4,Ahill' monument
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandals have defaced an ancient site on
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man.
OL,9,FGraffiti has been daubed over stones at
OL,10,FHango Hill, a Bronze Age burial mound
OL,11,Fand a Viking execution site near
OL,12,FCastletown in the south of the island.
OL,14,FManx National Heritage (MNH) said it
OL,15,Fwas "shocked and disappointed" by the
OL,16,Fincident.
OL,18,FThe organisation said signs on the site
OL,19,Fclearly showed it was a criminal
OL,20,Foffence to deface an ancient monument,
OL,21,Fand that it had reported it to the
OL,22,Fpolice.
